   based on them (a "Derivative").

   "You" means the person or organization using the Software.

   "Large Organization" means any organization that, in the last twelve months,
   had more than 50 employees, members of staff or contractors in total
   (counting affiliates under common control), OR more than USD 1,000,000 in
   annual revenue, budget or funding. A person using the Software for an
   employer or client is treated as that organization.

   "Government Body" means any national, regional or local government, any
   public agency, ministry, court, legislature, military or police body, any
   state-owned or state-controlled entity, and any contractor acting for one of
   them in that capacity.

   "Resale" means selling, renting, leasing, sublicensing or otherwise charging
   for the Software, for access to it, or for a hosted or managed service built
   on it, or bundling it into anything that is sold.

